### 9. Technical Architecture (Proposed)

- **Frontend**: Vue 3 + Vite + Tailwind (reuse Crypto Map component lib)
- **Backend**: Supabase (Postgres, Row‑Level Security, Edge Functions)
- **Third‑Party APIs**: Google Business Profile, Twitter API v2, Perplexity Search API, Grok (X AI) via SSE
- **Auth**: Supabase Auth with Google provider
- **Jobs**: Cloudflare Workers (cron) for nightly GBP sync & lead ingest

