### 11. Out‑of‑Scope (v1)

- In‑dashboard payment processing or POS tools
- Non‑Google SSO (Apple, X, etc.)
- Writing updates back to GBP (will revisit if API quotas allow)

---

### 12. Risks & Mitigations

| Risk                        | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation                                        |
| --------------------------- | ---------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |
| Google API quota limits     | Medium     | High   | Batch sync, cache, request higher quota early     |
| Inaccurate outreach leads   | High       | Medium | Score + manual vet by Growth before contact       |
| Spam or malicious edits     | Medium     | Medium | Rate‑limit writes, captcha, audit trail           |
| Compliance with Twitter TOS | Medium     | Medium | Use official API; cache only IDs, not full tweets |

